pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [26, 16, 908, 42]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      wrap: false
      text: 10-24 评审：方向正确、既有仿真不必重跑，主线转向实验标定与模型判别
  - elementId: box1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [26, 88, 908, 112]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$graybg"}
  - elementId: box1txt
    elementType: text
    bounds: [46, 100, 868, 88]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>评审总判断（2026-10-24，附 12 项分级改进与验收标准）</strong></p>
        <p>方向正确；既有仿真不必重跑。主线由「仿真可行性」转向「实验标定与模型判别」——候选机制（LuGre 与率态摩擦）与两个候选子模型<span style="color:$blue">并行保留，不提前拍板</span>。</p>
  - elementId: box2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [26, 216, 908, 148]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$graybg"}
  - elementId: box2txt
    elementType: text
    bounds: [46, 228, 868, 124]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>测量约束（达不到的预言一律标注「当前不可检验」）</strong></p>
        <p>· 最短卸载事件约 0.05 ms → 需约 <strong>200 kS/s</strong>；换向滞后约 0.009 ms → 需约 <strong>1.1 MS/s</strong>——240 fps 视频与 44.1 kHz 声学均不足。</p>
        <p>· 仿真名义速度 0.5 m/s 与主装置规划 0.01–0.20 m/s <span style="color:$magenta">不匹配</span>：实验对照按 ε/v 等无量纲量组织，不直接对比名义速度。</p>
  - elementId: box3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [26, 380, 908, 112]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$graybg"}
  - elementId: box3txt
    elementType: text
    bounds: [46, 392, 868, 88]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>模型欠账（辨识路线的边界）</strong></p>
        <p>E6A 的 I–N 关系为准静态平均，<span style="color:$magenta">不能直接用于</span>毫秒级 N(t) 反演；LuGre 动态参数与率态 D_c 不能由 E1/E2 单独辨识——需速度 / 载荷阶跃或「滑移—停止—再滑移」瞬态实验。</p>
  - elementId: cite
    elementType: text
    bounds: [26, 512, 908, 16]
    content:
      style: "$cite"
      wrap: false
      text: 来源：2026-10-24 研究进度评审（docs/研究记录/，12 项分级改进附验收标准）
